<title>UK: Safeway yr underlying pretax profits slip.</title>
<headline>Safeway yr underlying pretax profits slip.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending March 29</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		26.8		   vs 26.4</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 9.70		   vs 8.70</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 14.10		  vs 12.75</p>
<p>Pretax, pre-property</p>
<p> loss			 430.1		  vs n/a</p>
<p> Pretax		     420.6		  vs 429.4</p>
<p> Turnover		   6,589.7		vs 6,069.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 425 and 435 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Safeway Plc</p>
